# Level Up

How is your drum and dance experience? Have you made some progress? Does anything sound or feel familiar? No? That's ok! Remember to give yourself 6-8 weeks to start integrating the rhythms and you can always speed up this learning by practicing at home. 10mins a day is all it takes to go over the class content. Have you used your FREE class for a friend voucher? Dancers, have you taken your FREE drum class yet? Don't forget to take up these offers! It will only strengthen your drum and dance community connections.

**Is It Time To Level Up?**

Did you know? Once you have completed a 4-week drumming course, you are welcome to stay and drum for the dancers! That is one extra hour of drumming for FREE. There is only one way to improve and that is to play! Watch the rhythms come together for the dance. This experience strengthens your understanding of the rhythms, calls and breaks. It is also a fantastic way to build your endurance. So, take this opportunity to improve your playing. Sign up for your next course [here](/product/4-class-pass-drum-dance-classes/).

**Is It Time To Take The Next Step?**

We are offering new students a FREE 4-week course with every drum purchase. That's right, you get 4 weeks of tuition for free if you buy a drum! This offer is only valid if you are in your first 4 weeks of drumming or dancing. You can buy a ready-made drum handcrafted by Nathaniel or you can purchase a custom-made order by chatting with us. Sound, colour, size ...all of these things matter and we can help you choose your perfect drumming partner. Take the next step and commit to your new drumming journey!
